{"id":"n38073-1-12","stage":5,"title":"기이하다 · 奇异","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n38073-1-12-1","ko":"저 바위는 마치 사람이 누워 있는 모습처럼 생겼어.","zh":"那块石头看起来就像有人躺着一样。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71214","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"바위는","meaning":"岩石","explanation":"바위：岩石；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"바위","audio":"/audio/e51e6c52f2963665e990.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57558","senseId":"1","lemma":"바위","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마치","meaning":"犹如，仿佛，好像","explanation":"마치：犹如，仿佛，好像","readings":[{"term":"마치","audio":"/audio/64c09c33fcaaef3d22ce.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56092","senseId":"1","lemma":"마치","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람이","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"누워","meaning":"躺","explanation":"눕다：躺；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"눕다","audio":"/audio/aaed3d6f391054fec9e8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62063","senseId":"1","lemma":"눕다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있는","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모습처럼","meaning":"样子，景象，状况","explanation":"모습：样子，景象，状况；처럼：表示相似：“像……一样”。","readings":[{"term":"모습","audio":"/audio/4b8858fa4bec51bc3aa6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62383","senseId":"2","lemma":"모습","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생겼어.","meaning":"长","explanation":"생기다：长；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"생기다","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67898","senseId":"4","lemma":"생기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"那","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"71214","definition":"指代离说话人和听话人较远的对象。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"e51e6c52f2963665","term":"바위","zh":"岩石","audio":"/audio/e51e6c52f2963665e990.mp3","entryId":"57558","definition":"非常大的石头。","pronunciation":["바위"]},{"id":"64c09c33fcaaef3d","term":"마치","zh":"犹如，仿佛，好像","audio":"/audio/64c09c33fcaaef3d22ce.mp3","entryId":"56092","definition":"与别的相比较而言。","pronunciation":["마치"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"可以思考，会制造并使用语言和工具、构成社会而生活的存在。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"aaed3d6f391054fe","term":"눕다","zh":"躺","audio":"/audio/aaed3d6f391054fec9e8.mp3","entryId":"62063","definition":"人或动物将背部或肋部贴附在某处而横躺下。","pronunciation":["눕ː따"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"4b8858fa4bec51bc","term":"모습","zh":"样子，景象，状况","audio":"/audio/4b8858fa4bec51bc3aa6.mp3","entryId":"62383","definition":"表露于外的状态或形貌。","pronunciation":["모습"]},{"id":"fc2a5a2e23bd6357","term":"생기다","zh":"长","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3","entryId":"67898","definition":"人或事物的长相成为某种样子。","pronunciation":["생기다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2f835ca1b59a2d082ff7.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n38073-1-12-2","ko":"그러게. 정말 기이한 모양의 바위야.","zh":"是啊，形状真是奇特呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그러게.","meaning":"就是嘛，可不嘛","explanation":"그러게：就是嘛，可不嘛","readings":[{"term":"그러게","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36269","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{